        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "You'll find the most delicious chocolates in this shop, like nothing you'll find elsewhere. So many different flavours, shapes, special occasion, all delicious! They even make chocolate boards, like charcuterie boards, but chocolates and goodies. There is also a great assortment of gifts and food items, great for hostess gifts or just a little surprise for someone. Last, but certainly not least, the ladies in this shop are so helpful and kind. Make this a stop on your way home or make a special trip, it will be well worth it!",
        "time": 1724341732,
        "translated": false
      },
